Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OpenXT]

A control socket created before the udev_runtime_t transition is still
tmpfs_t. udev has to unlink that socket.

--- a/policy/modules/system/udev.te
+++ b/policy/modules/system/udev.te
@@ -93,6 +93,7 @@
 fs_tmpfs_filetrans(udev_t, udev_runtime_t, sock_file, "control")
 fs_watch_tmpfs_dirs(udev_t)
 allow udev_t udev_runtime_t:dir watch;
+allow udev_t tmpfs_t:sock_file unlink;
 
 kernel_load_module(udev_t)
 kernel_read_system_state(udev_t)
